  "content": "<p>\n  使<strong>不死圖騰</strong>在手持時顯示為<strong>動畫河豚桶</strong>，由 Punchy 和 Refined Buckets 驅動。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b566fb8def522cb658008a9a49539e9c16678c3_0.webp\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"手持時河豚桶取代不死圖騰\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lqNBiv3L/images/5d2f2d918a9f0193a9c74b6eaa07606227392e95.gif\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"動畫展示：手持時圖騰變為動畫河豚桶\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><em>動畫展示：物品欄中顯示一般圖騰，手持時變為動畫河豚桶</em></p>\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🔗 需求</h3>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/refined-buckets\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f76489844cb9eca9c773e370b5c982ad3ef05fa.png\"\n         width=\"300\"\n         alt=\"需要 Refined Buckets 資源包\">\n  </a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fad1074568a3441a24b311f5b453c45bb9e2b619.png\"\n         width=\"270\"\n         alt=\"需要 Punchy 模組\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n### ⚙️ 安裝方法\n\n1. 安裝**Refined Buckets**與**Punchy**\n2. 將此資源包置於**Refined Buckets 上方**\n\n**疑難排解**\n- 若手持物品顯示錯位或行為異常，請嘗試在 Punchy 設定中停用*物品物理*\n\n### 📜 致謝\n\n- Refined Buckets 提供模型與動畫  \n- Punchy 提供物品動畫系統",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
